{"overview":"ژاپن توسط امپراتوری بریتانیا اشغال و فتح شده است. ژاپن اکنون به عنوان منطقه ۱۱ شناخته می‌شود و شهروندان آن به عنوان «اِلِفینز» شناخته می‌شوند. امپراتوری بریتانیا قدرت خودمختار ژاپن را از او می‌گیرد و حکمرانی خود را از طریق استفاده از نائیت‌مارس اعمال می‌کند. حکومت امپراتوری هرگز تضعیف نشده، اما ترک‌خوردگی‌ها شروع به نشان دادن می‌کنند…","tagline":"","overview_en":"Japan has been invaded and conquered by the Britannian Empire. Japan is now known as Area 11 and its citizens known as Elevens. The Britannian Empire takes away Japan's autonomous power and imposes its rule through the use of Knightmares. The Empire's rule has never faltered, but cracks have begun to show...","tagline_en":"","runtime":25,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":44,"y":2006,"poster":"/vCoWndkCg78FPBH2phibnaPo3k0.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":25,"y":2006,"poster":"/yPydgYVBroX5APwD3B93M359cb1.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":25,"y":2008,"poster":"/iVeQK1CWNHddWnHIjQqRROts6kw.jpg"}],"episodes":50,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"福山潤","role":"Lelouch (voice)","photo":"/eT9eloyIaIkTvTqMmpcsAleP2hM.jpg","en":"Jun Fukuyama"},{"name":"櫻井孝宏","role":"Suzaku (voice)","photo":"/8s8owcKmpRAuhzEGjSdRpztthUg.jpg","en":"Takahiro Sakurai"},{"name":"ゆかな","role":"C.C. (voice)","photo":"/AeRUkifrHsx0ZYfRRf64gChACyg.jpg","en":"Yukana"},{"name":"小清水亜美","role":"Kallen (voice)","photo":"/e5sU0stGjTMtFoj0jjHH7OFUqYC.jpg","en":"Ami Koshimizu"}],"trailer":"so4b3W5R2Bs","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31724/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31724/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunch